<title>NETHERLANDS: Reuters 3rd ex-Amsterdam to Asia/MidEast Air Cargo.</title>
<headline>Reuters 3rd ex-Amsterdam to Asia/MidEast Air Cargo.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current airfreight rates from Amsterdam to key destinations in the MidEast and Asia Latin America and Europe. These are current Dutch gilder rates per kilo for a 100kg shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>			   May 28    March 25</p>
<p>				 ASIA</p>
<p>AMS-HKG		  2.95	2.90</p>
<p>AMS-SIN		  2.60	2.70</p>
<p>AMS-NRT		  4.50	4.50</p>
<p>AMS-TPE		  2.55	2.60</p>
<p>AMS-SEL		  4.10	4.10</p>
<p>AMS-KUL		  2.55	2.60</p>
<p>			     AUSTRALIA</p>
<p>AMS-SYD		  4.30	4.30</p>
<p>			  INDIAN SUB-CONTINENT</p>
<p>AMS-BOM		  2.15	2.15</p>
<p>			    MIDDLE-EAST</p>
<p>AMS-DXB		  1.75	1.65</p>
<p>AMS-BAH		  2.60	2.60</p>
<p>AMS-MCT (Muscat)     2.85	2.85</p>
<p>AMS-AUH (Abu Dhabi)  2.45	2.35</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, forwarders and smaller air cargo agents.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in Dutch guilders per kg.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market actvity.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
